T* (should be addressed in accordance with organizational risk management policies. A further 12 Medium and) Tj
T* (15 Low severity issues were observed, along with 24 informational items that support asset and) Tj
T* (configuration visibility. It is recommended that remediation efforts prioritise externally exposed systems and) Tj
T* (unsupported software, followed by a verification scan to confirm closure.) Tj
